{"name": "Oink Splash Party", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Oink Splash Party!  </h2><br/>Dive into the wildest party on the open sea, where Oinks battle across giant inflatable waterparks.<br/><br/>Compete in frantic matches packed with physics-driven mayhem, score goals, complete objectives, and knock opponents straight into the sea.<br/><br/>Become an Oink, customize your look, and jump into unpredictable multiplayer battles with friends and rivals alike!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chaos You Can Control </h2><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Inflate yourself to turn into a bouncing ball<br/></li><li>Deflate mid-air to control your landing<br/></li><li>Stomp on inflatables to reach impossible places<br/></li><li>Smash into opponents and send them SPLASH into the water</li></ul><br/>No two matches ever feel the same.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/a763750f971e23a0e3f302b1e80c20b7.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/a763750f971e23a0e3f302b1e80c20b7.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/a763750f971e23a0e3f302b1e80c20b7.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/9923ece53bbdedbb96c526f147edbd8f.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/9923ece53bbdedbb96c526f147edbd8f.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/9923ece53bbdedbb96c526f147edbd8f.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7eb791c809be37cdabcf7481f40b7d73.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7eb791c809be37cdabcf7481f40b7d73.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7eb791c809be37cdabcf7481f40b7d73.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Giant Inflatable Waterparks </h2><br/>Battle across vibrant floating arenas packed with:<br/><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Massive bouncy platforms<br/></li><li>Crazy inflatable obstacles<br/></li><li>Slides, gaps, and risky shortcuts<br/></li><li>Fun objectives that require the best team</li></ul><br/>Fall into the sea? No problem. Swim back and jump straight into the chaos-packed action again.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"508\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/020a1c8c28a88c083da7c3bd299c9427.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/020a1c8c28a88c083da7c3bd299c9427.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/020a1c8c28a88c083da7c3bd299c9427.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Party Modes &amp; Fun Rivalry </h2><br/>Play with friends \u2014 or against them \u2014 in fast-paced, competitive modes:<br/><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Score Battle</strong></li></ul>Outplay your opponents and score your way to victory.<br/><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Galleon Rush</strong></li></ul>Grab more coins than everyone else\u2026 and don\u2019t get punched off!<br/><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Punch King</strong></li></ul>Fight for the highest point of the waterpark and defend your crown from oinks trying to knock you off.<br/><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Private Matches</strong></li></ul>Create custom games with your own rules and enjoy chaotic battles with friends.<br/><br/>More modes are on the way!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"372\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/d15306be4801e95ddd3e4140a163a691.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/d15306be4801e95ddd3e4140a163a691.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/d15306be4801e95ddd3e4140a163a691.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make Your Oink Yours  </h2><br/>Stand out in the splash:<br/><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your Oink\u2019s look<br/></li><li>Express your oinky-style<br/></li><li>Be the most iconic piggy in the park!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/74c26b846f5a9cb0eb7f20436119da8a.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/74c26b846f5a9cb0eb7f20436119da8a.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/74c26b846f5a9cb0eb7f20436119da8a.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2><br/>Our Oinks are busy inflating waterparks and testing questionable ideas, but the best feedback usually comes from players.<br/><br/><strong>Why Early Access?</strong><br/><br/>Because party games are better when they're built with the people who play them.<br/><br/>We need your help testing maps, sharing feedback, reporting bugs, and deciding what chaos comes next.<br/><br/><strong>Oink Splash Party launches in Early Access with:</strong><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 unique waterpark maps<br/></li><li>Party and private matches<br/></li><li>Map missions and character customization</li></ul><br/>Multiple game modes, maps, and surprises are already being baked and will be coming soon!<br/><br/><strong>Join us early and help our Oinks shape the party!</strong><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.poster.avif?t=1790273769\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.webm?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.mp4?t=1790273769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </div>", "short_desc": "A chaotic multiplayer party brawler where bouncy piggies battle across giant inflatable waterparks! Punch, bounce, and inflate your way to victory.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/d92fdf21d0b355dee73ec7127e8784d40fc193d4/header.jpg?t=1790273769", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Multiplayer", "Party Game", "Online Co-Op", "PvP", "Team-Based"], "developers": "Team Chili", "publishers": "Team Chili", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4660200", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/J9K8zTRAGuk", "first_seen": 1791324000.0, "review_rank": 24}